    "data": "\n    <div class=\"min-h-screen bg-slate-100 flex justify-center p-6\"><div class=\"w-full max-w-2xl flex flex-col gap-6\"><header class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900\">API Cache</h1><p class=\"text-slate-600\">Query.define owns each fetch and its retained data. The parent decides when each Query should load or refresh.</p></header><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\"><div role=\"tablist\" aria-orientation=\"horizontal\" aria-label=\"API cache sections\" class=\"flex gap-2\"><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"api-cache-query-tabs-panel-0\" data-selected=\"\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-white text-slate-600 font-semibold hover:bg-slate-50 transition cursor-pointer data-[selected]:bg-indigo-600 data-[selected]:text-white data-[selected]:hover:bg-indigo-600\" id=\"api-cache-query-tabs-tab-0\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">Posts</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-white text-slate-600 font-semibold hover:bg-slate-50 transition cursor-pointer data-[selected]:bg-indigo-600 data-[selected]:text-white data-[selected]:hover:bg-indigo-600\" id=\"api-cache-query-tabs-tab-1\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\">Stats</button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"api-cache-query-tabs-tab-0\" data-selected=\"\" class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" id=\"api-cache-query-tabs-panel-0\" tabindex=\"0\"><section class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-800\">Posts</h2><button class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-white text-slate-700 text-sm font-semibold rounded-md shadow hover:bg-slate-50 transition cursor-pointer data-[disabled]:opacity-50 data-[disabled]:cursor-default data-[disabled]:hover:bg-white\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">Refresh</button></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500\">Open a post, then go back. The detail stays in the Query. Opening it ag